  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Regent was born when Coventry Metal Works, the designers of the Hauptmann, managed to secure construction rights for an updated version of the original design after help by the ilKhanate. The efficiency of Clan technology meant that the Hauptmann could be replicated on a lighter chassis. Coventry technicians revised their schematics to employ the more readily available 270-rated engine and Clan heat sinks. The 'Mech shed five tons and a significant amount in production costs. Many MechWarriors refer to the resulting product as the Awesomann, a ridiculous yet accurate nickname for the imposing 'Mech, leading pilots of alternate configurations to call their rides Fafnirmann, Maulermann, and others.",
